                        "target_lang_word": "adultery",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "adultery",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ac71f7e5-48eb-3e79-9e80-8b894028b59e",
                                        "entry_id": "cb839db5-8144-334e-b191-507cfdd2a7ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sexual intercourse by a married person with someone other than their spouse. See more synonyms at Thesaurus:cuckoldry"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f349c672-6ac1-45c7-a3c0-6be9449a258c",
                                                "sense_id": "ac71f7e5-48eb-3e79-9e80-8b894028b59e",
                                                "text": "Under modern statutory law, some courts hold that the unmarried participant isn't guilty of adultery (that only the married participant is)"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b5a6a7c-bfa7-4f16-b824-6985c4667a3e",
                                                "sense_id": "ac71f7e5-48eb-3e79-9e80-8b894028b59e",
                                                "text": "She engaged in adultery because her spouse has a low libido, while hers is very high."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac2e8a61-be64-4bb0-b1da-2db66a613450",
                                                "sense_id": "ac71f7e5-48eb-3e79-9e80-8b894028b59e",
                                                "text": "So also that copulation which in one City is Matrimony, in another will be judged Adultery."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1146c302-2562-42c3-8a4f-d55071620f00",
                                                "sense_id": "ac71f7e5-48eb-3e79-9e80-8b894028b59e",
                                                "text": "Ironically, the detergent industry-sponsored \"soap operas\" that are central to modern afternoon television programming promise (mostly) female viewers both relief from drudgery and escape into the dramatic, crisis-filled on-air world of (laundryless) marriages, adulteries, and other relationships."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8bbf4272-7d75-3aee-8b0e-4887d11980f8",
                                        "entry_id": "cb839db5-8144-334e-b191-507cfdd2a7ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lewdness or unchastity of thought as well as act, as forbidden by the sixth/seventh commandment; sinful sexual behavior as a category."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45577010-9ef3-43f4-939c-0f8bc8878ca9",
                                                "sense_id": "8bbf4272-7d75-3aee-8b0e-4887d11980f8",
                                                "text": "Thou shalt not commit adultery."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "15feded2-01ef-336c-bdae-f5923f4f551c",
                                        "entry_id": "cb839db5-8144-334e-b191-507cfdd2a7ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Faithlessness in religion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8dad138f-1b13-442c-b761-c301d4f35fb9",
                                                "sense_id": "15feded2-01ef-336c-bdae-f5923f4f551c",
                                                "text": "And it came to pass through the lightness of her whoredom, that she defiled the land, and committed adultery with stones and with stocks."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "66374dc4-0be6-3c2c-8ea1-26445ef3a71a",
                                        "entry_id": "cb839db5-8144-334e-b191-507cfdd2a7ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The fine and penalty formerly imposed for the offence of adultery."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "085d7201-13a6-316b-ac10-940d58fce5df",
                                        "entry_id": "cb839db5-8144-334e-b191-507cfdd2a7ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The intrusion of a person into a bishopric during the life of the bishop."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1675bcd-5d27-37db-8245-21c46175bb3c",
                                        "entry_id": "cb839db5-8144-334e-b191-507cfdd2a7ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Adulteration; corruption."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
